    "source": "Upload and @rc-component/upload 1.1.1 AjaxUploader onFilePaste/onDataTransferFiles",
    "observation": "Document paste scope; synchronous prevention only for file data, single drop/paste takes first original file before accept, multiple uses forced accept. beforeUpload=false avoids transport. Raw disabled/provider-disabled cases still call beforeUpload and onChange: missing disabled guard in Source document handler. Native preserves disabled blocking instead of copying this defect. Dynamic pastable and unmount recorded without Source patches/private APIs; generated UID excluded."
